msgctxt "64"
msgid "Wait up, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"I saw you in there flinging those fists of yours at the boss! Pretty dang "
"impressive, I've gotta say!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "Sorry, Nishida. I'm kinda in a hurry here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Oh, right... Guess I'll let you go then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"Hey, but before you do! We're dusting off the ol' Coliseum\r\n"
"and opening it back up for full-time business! Haven't seen\r\n"
"the boss this pumped since that time he gave me acupuncture!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"Anyway, we've got a lot of beefy fighters lined up, so drop\r\n"
"by and take a few swings when you get the chance!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Thanks, Nishida. I will."
msgstr ""

